; Each frame's values and steps in, the ten steps of the frame out (20 samples each): for every step V, P and A
; to the excitation machine and K10 down to K1 to the coefficient machine, each K after the step's A, and each value
; then moved on by its step.
; The values and steps go round through this machine's own pile (OUT at 08, 25, 26, 34, 35, 45 and 46 come back
; to INP at 06, 19, 21, 27, 29, 39 and 41): at a new frame the old ones are read off and the new ones put on.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            frame   INP   v        03-17: a new frame's V, and its 24 cards onto the pile in place of the old
  04                    CLA   n23
  05                    STO   i
  06            drain   CLA   z        (CLA z at the first frame, INP x after)
  07            cp      INP   x
  08                    OUT   x
  09                    CLA   i
  10                    SUB   00
  11                    STO   i
  12                    TAC   go
  13                    JMP   drain
  14            go      CLA   inpx
  15                    STO   drain
  16                    CLA   n9
  17                    STO   s
  18            step    OUT   v        18-35: V, P and A out; P and A moved on
  19                    INP   x
  20                    OUT   x
  21                    INP   d
  22                    CLA   x
  23                    ADD   d
  24                    STO   x
  25                    OUT   x
  26                    OUT   d
  27                    INP   x
  28                    OUT   x
  29                    INP   d
  30                    CLA   x
  31                    STO   a
  32                    ADD   d
  33                    STO   x
  34                    OUT   x
  35                    OUT   d
  36                    CLA   n9       36-51: the ten Ks out, each moved on
  37                    STO   j
  38            k       OUT   a        (each K comes after the step's A, for the rounding)
  39                    INP   x
  40                    OUT   x
  41                    INP   d
  42                    CLA   x
  43                    ADD   d
  44                    STO   x
  45                    OUT   x
  46                    OUT   d
  47                    CLA   j
  48                    SUB   00
  49                    STO   j
  50                    TAC   nxt
  51                    JMP   k
  52            nxt     CLA   s        52-56: ten steps, then the next frame
  53                    SUB   00
  54                    STO   s
  55                    TAC   frame
  56                    JMP   step
  60            v       DATA  0
  61            x       DATA  0
  62            d       DATA  0
  63            i       DATA  0
  64            j       DATA  0
  65            s       DATA  0
  66            n23     DATA  23
  67            n9      DATA  9
  68            inpx    INP   x
  69            z       DATA  0
  70            a       DATA  0
